            "review_title": "Review at Akataiyo",
            "review_text": "Mcinty\nVietnam8 contributions\n0\nClean and neat food\nMar 2021 • Couples\nThis is the most satisfying restaurant for me among the many Japanese restaurants In Hanoi. I think it's a stable taste that you can eat with confidence. The price is also cheap from the quality of food. Lovely people, great fresh food!\nSushi here are absolutely amazing! Thanks\nStrongly recommended.\nWritten March 17, 2021",
